      "message": "Hi Greg,\n\nSee commit message. Running\n\n```\ntools/bazel run //common:checkpatch\n```\n\nruns this script: https://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:build/kernel/kleaf/impl/checkpatch.sh\n\n... (which is a re-write of this legacy script, though with slightly different flags and sementics https://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:build/kernel/static_analysis/checkpatch.sh )\n\nBoth the new and the old `checkpatch.sh` calls `git format-patch` to create a patch of either HEAD or a given git sha1 from flags, then executes scripts/checkpatch.pl on the patch:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:build/kernel/kleaf/impl/checkpatch.sh;l\u003d71;drc\u003d4a7ab9fbb2926a2cc43639618f01d7c0b12f2d07",
